REMARK 600                                                                      
REMARK 600 HETEROGEN                                                            
REMARK 600                                                                      
REMARK 600 THE MESNA MOLECULES (RESIDUE COM) WHICH ARE VERY FLEXIBLE, ARE       
REMARK 600 POORLY ORDERED IN THE STRUCTURE. THE AUTHORS KNOW FROM MASS          
REMARK 600 SPECTROSCOPY DATA THAT 1-2 MESNA MOLECULES ARE ATTACHED PER PROTEIN  
REMARK 600 CHAIN. MOREOVER, AS MESNA IS COVALENT ATTACHED TO THE PROTEIN PRIOR  
REMARK 600 TO CRYSTALLIZATION, MESNA MUST BE PRESENT AT THE SAME SITE IN ALL    
REMARK 600 MOLECULES. SINCE MESNA IS FAIRLY CLEARLY EVIDENT IN COPY-A IT MUST   
REMARK 600 BE PRESENT IN OTHER PROTEIN COPIES EVEN IF THE DENSITY IS VERY WEAK  
REMARK 600 AT SOME SITES                                                        
